  "scripts": {
    "dev": "next dev",
    "build": "next build",
    "start": "next start"
  }
}
```

### Using Webpack instead

If you need to use Webpack instead of Turbopack, you can opt-in with the `--webpack` flag:

```json filename="package.json"
